are up with Pieter, Gitedale trip\", \"what does Emrys Fealuham owe me, Gitedale trip?\"], [\"umm can you open the Chess night album\", \"ok and the, uh, the Nirara one — which album's that in?\", \"oh, different thing, can you square up with Pieter for the Gitedale trip?\", \"and umm how much does Emrys Fealuham owe me in the, uh, Gitedale trip?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w18-0050\", \"v\": [[\"Would you mind making the hall an hour earlier, please?\"], [\"I've realised I'll never get everything cleared away in time otherwise, so could you shift the hall an hour earlier for me?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w18-0051\", \"v\": [[\"aqueduct — which paperwork?\", \"and in tasks?\"], [\"anything mentioning aqueduct in my paperwork\", \"what about in my tasks\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w18-0052\", \"v\": [[\"where was the springs photo taken?\", \"photos from there\", \"which album's it in?\", \"other shots in there?\"], [\"I'm trying to remember that trip properly, so where was the springs photo taken?\", \"Oh right, that place — I'd love to look back at it, can you show me the photos from there?\", \"That's the one I was thinking of, and I'd like to find it again later, so which album is it in?\", \"I'm curious what else I've tucked away with it — what other shots are in there?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w18-0053\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me how much I've spent in Zermatt, please?\", \"Oh, hang on — could you tell me which appointments I have tuesday?\", \"Thank you. Going back to what we were looking at before, could you show me its expenses, please?\"], [\"umm how much have I, like, spent in Zermatt?\", \"oh wait, hang on — what appointments have I got tuesday?\", \"ok, uh, back to the other thing — can you show me the expenses for it?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w18-0054\", \"v\": [[\"umm what've I actually been spending on in Zermatt? like, the expenses\"], [\"Could you show me what I've spent money on in Zermatt, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w18-0055\", \"v\": [[\"I want to show something to someone later, so could you dig out my Nirara pictures for me?\", \"Oh, that's a lovely one — I honestly can't remember where we were, so where was it taken?\", \"Changing the subject, I need to get in touch with someone, so can you bring up Jessamy Fealuham's contact card?\", \"I actually already texted them today, so could you log that so I don't lose track?\"], [\"umm can you show me my Nirara pictures?\", \"and uh where was that taken?\", \"oh, different thing — can you pull up, um, Jessamy Fealuham's contact card\", \"ok so I texted them today, can you, like, log that?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w18-0058\", \"v\": [[\"Someone was asking me about a restaurant and I've completely blanked, so who did I have dinner with last monday?\"], [\"who did i have dinner w last monday\"]]}","ttft_ms":31305,"type":"result","duration_ms":44327,"uuid":"6997c25a-a02e-417f-9594-4fdbf8386b4d","ttft_stream_ms":1635,"time_to_request_ms":117,"first_content_frame_ms":1636,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22156613,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278706832.5103,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
